node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2025-10-10T12:30:37Z","updated_at":"2025-10-10T15:58:08Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nv4.5.stable.nixpkgs [https://github.com/godotengine/godot/commit/876b290332ec6f2e6d173d08162a02aa7e6ca46d]\n\n### System information\n\nnixos, vulkan, forward+\n\n### Issue description\n\nLight Size does not seem to be taken in account when rendering an omnilight on layer 2\n\n<img width=\"1580\" height=\"992\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/24ca78c1-bdc4-418e-af4b-0d6b223b9b16\" />\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. open the reference scene\n2. observe the red omnilight has a small reflection\n3. observe all the other lights have big reflections\n4. move the `light_cull_mask` and `layers` to the first\n5. move layer of Plane_001 to 1 as well\n6. observe big red reflection\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[specular-highlight-test.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/22849763/specular-highlight-test.zip)\n(this is not _quite_ minimal, but I found this bug while creating an MRP for a seperate bug and I think this one is easy enough to not need an MRP)\n\n## Additional Notes\nThis may be a quirk that nobody is ever going to notice if left unfixed. But I found it while creating a reference project for #111457 so for completeness sake I reported it.","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111